                "name": "current_page",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query"
              },
              {
                "name": "c",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "The `c` parameter is the cursor you should use to fetch the next page of results"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Lists the trades history based on the filtering criteria.\n\n**Attention:** Due to performance concerns, this endpoint now uses cursor-based pagination. The pagination object currently included in the response is now a placeholder and will be entirely removed as of 2026-06-01. The parameter current_page is also a placeholder and will be removed at the same time. Please update your integration accordingly and refer to the documentation for the correct pagination handling."
        },
